guide polestar-completionist-horde/class-warlock
title Warlock class quests (10-60) (Completionist)
faction Horde
class Warlock
levels 10-60
category Class
zone Durotar
why Every Warlock class quest from level 10 on, in level order. The earlier ones are in the starting zone guides.
reward text What the Warlock quests give, quest by quest: abilities, forms, pets, totems or gear.
# Drafted from the reference data and repaired from lint: not yet played.
# Routed 22 quests; estimated level at the end 15.4 (heuristic XP).
# Skipped: 22 exclusive with N; 4 prerequisite N not in this route; 3 objective N (talk N) outside the zones; 2 objective N (item N) outside the zones; 1 objective N (kill N) outside the zones.

